# Statics that crates/lector-review may declare, by item name (ADR 0001): immutable lookup tables
# such as compiled regexes and tree-sitter query tables held in a OnceLock. One name per line,
# each with a reason.

# Compiled regex table of the risk signals (crates/lector-review/src/risk/patterns.rs): immutable once built.
RISK_PATTERNS
# Compiled regex table of the content signals (crates/lector-review/src/risk/signals.rs): immutable once built.
SIGNAL_PATTERNS
